        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up, demon! You are trapped in a surreal freak show where space itself wants to destroy you. From above, from the bottomless darkness, giant cubes are inexorably falling - symbols of pure, soulless order, seeking to erase your chaotic essence. Each floor is a new arena for a deadly ballet. Jump, slide, roll - do everything to avoid a fatal blow. Your salvation is in constant movement and searching for the nearest door to the next platform, where only a new round of madness awaits. Save yourself or be crushed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Laugh - 2d platformer with puzzle elements. The player needs to move and jump on falling cubes to climb to inaccessible heights and enter the door to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>",
